<title>ISRAEL: Israeli parliament passes first reading of '97 budget.</title>
<headline>Israeli parliament passes first reading of '97 budget.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's parliament gave preliminary approval on Wednesday for the 1997 budget by a slim margin.</p>
<p>After intense negotiations lasting most of the day to ensure support from the full coalition, the 120-member parliament approved the controversial budget by a vote of 59-52 with five members abstaining.</p>
</text>
